= ESMC의 SAE 잠재 공간

_Language Modeling Materializes a World Model of Protein Biology_, 부록 A.4

2026-11-12 작성. Candido, Hayes, Derry, Rao, Lin, Verkuil 외 123명, bioRxiv 프리프린트(2026-06-04), #link("https://doi.org/10.64898/2026.06.03.729735")[doi:10.64898/2026.06.03.729735]

